        "instruction": "Put the steps in order from eating food to cells releasing energy.",
        "items": [
          "Food enters the mouth and is physically broken into smaller pieces.",
          "Food moves through the esophagus to the stomach.",
          "The stomach mixes food with acid and enzymes.",
          "Most chemical digestion and nutrient absorption occur in the small intestine.",
          "Blood transports absorbed nutrients such as glucose to body cells.",
          "Cells use glucose and oxygen during cellular respiration to release energy."
