          "Air enters through the nose or mouth.",
          "Air travels down the trachea and into the bronchi.",
          "Air reaches alveoli in the lungs.",
          "Oxygen moves from alveoli into capillaries.",
          "The heart pumps oxygen-rich blood through arteries.",
          "Oxygen moves from blood into muscle cells."
        ],
